ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a coffee shop, the waitress Xiao Li is serving drinks to customers. She tells the customer Xiao Zhang, \"We offer 30 different types of coffee, most are lattes, some are cappuccinos, but there are almost no American coffees.\" Xiao Zhang looks at the menu and finds only 4 types of cappuccinos.\n\n[Question]\nAfter looking at the menu, how many types of lattes does Xiao Zhang guess there are?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After looking at the menu, Xiao Zhang guesses there are 24 types of lattes.\nB. After looking at the menu, Xiao Zhang guesses there are 22 types of lattes.\nC. After looking at the menu, Xiao Zhang guesses there are 26 types of lattes.\nD. After looking at the menu, Xiao Zhang guesses there are 30 types of lattes.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0024725364279141967,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e077d6006945d27fc057","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367607410,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"65e63ea881ce4dc08df2607ec495c405"}